Long ago, the Earth was flat and smooth like a calm sea. The Sky grew lonely, for it could never touch the ground below. Day after day, the Sky stretched downward, but no matter how hard it tried, it could never reach the Earth.

The Earth saw the Sky's sadness and felt compassion. "I cannot come to you," whispered the Earth, "but perhaps I can help you reach me."

